@base <http://www.daml.org/services/owl-s/1.2/ActorDefault.owl>.

@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>.
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>.
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#>.
@prefix xml: <http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace>.
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>.
@prefix profile: <http://www.daml.org/services/owl-s/1.2/Profile.owl#>.
@prefix : <http://www.daml.org/services/owl-s/1.2/ActorDefault.owl#>.
@prefix w3: <http://www.w3.org/>.
@prefix owls_Profile: <http://www.daml.org/services/owl-s/1.2/Profile.owl#>.
@prefix owls_ActorDefault: <http://www.daml.org/services/owl-s/1.2/ActorDefault.owl#>.

<http://www.daml.org/services/owl-s/1.2/ActorDefault.owl> a owl:Ontology;
                                                          rdfs:comment """
      Actor Default Properties

      These were originally defined in previous versions of the DAML-S Profile,
      and provided a mechanism of declaring actors that were responsible for
      some given role within a service.
      
      -- These properties have now been removed from the DAML-S 0.9 Profile, and defined separately. --
      
      The abstraction of these parameters from the Profile ontology facilitates
      the usage of other ontologies for defining individual parameters, such
      as the foaf or vCard ontologies.

      See the discussion accompanying the DAML-S 0.9 release for further details.

      Created by Terry Payne (terryp@cs.cmu.edu).
    """;
                                                          rdfs:seeAlso <http://www.daml.org/services>;
                                                          owl:imports <http://www.daml.org/services/owl-s/1.2/Profile.owl>;
                                                          owl:versionInfo """
      $Id: ActorDefault.owl,v 1.8 2004/11/28 16:29:55 martin Exp $
    """.
:Actor a owl:Class;
       rdfs:comment """
      Actor represents a Requester or Provider who might request or offer a service.
      The original Actor definition was provided within DAML-S V0.5, V0.6 and V0.7
    """;
       rdfs:label "DefaultActor";
       rdfs:subClassOf owl:Thing.
:email a owl:DatatypeProperty;
       rdfs:domain :Actor;
       rdfs:range xsd:string.
:fax a owl:DatatypeProperty;
     rdfs:domain :Actor;
     rdfs:range xsd:string.
:name a owl:DatatypeProperty;
      rdfs:domain :Actor;
      rdfs:range xsd:string.
:phone a owl:DatatypeProperty;
       rdfs:domain :Actor;
       rdfs:range xsd:string.
:physicalAddress a owl:DatatypeProperty;
                 rdfs:domain :Actor;
                 rdfs:range xsd:string.
:title a owl:DatatypeProperty;
       rdfs:domain :Actor;
       rdfs:range xsd:string.
:webURL a owl:DatatypeProperty;
        rdfs:domain :Actor;
        rdfs:range xsd:string.
profile:contactInformation a owl:ObjectProperty;
                           rdfs:range :Actor.
